6
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.333
[Upbeat music kicks in] PANDA: CURSE OF THE PUMPKIN

7
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.800
RUN, JUMP AND DASH

8
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.800
BRAVE THE CURSED FOREST

9
00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:42.133
DEFEAT ANCIENT BOSSES

10
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:47.133
UNLOCK SKINS AND DASH TRAILS

11
00:00:51.567 --> 00:00:53.067
LIFT THE CURSE

12
00:00:53.417 --> 00:01:00.000
COMING SOON
